# scratch-devdocs/ stays gitignored (AGENTS.md). The architecture artifacts
# (devdocs/architecture/{crate-graph.json,DEPENDENCIES.md}) are regenerated
# locally by `cargo xtask arch gen`; `arch check` compares against the
# on-disk artifacts, so local gates work with devdocs/ untracked.
scratch-devdocs/
/target
/fuzz/corpus
!/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/corpus/**
/fuzz/corpus/scanner/
/fuzz/corpus/frontmatter_patcher/
/fuzz/corpus/frontmatter_patcher/*
!/fuzz/corpus/frontmatter_patcher/seed-commented-frontmatter
/fuzz/corpus/parity/
/fuzz/corpus/parity/*
!/fuzz/corpus/parity/seed-mixed-markdown
/fuzz/target
/fuzz/artifacts
*.profraw
*.profdata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
